# CV

Route `/cv`. Layout and sections stay in `components/cv/`. The lobby stays `app/page.tsx`.

- The page is a readable CV: identity, work, projects, contact. It is not a canvas experience and it does not synthesize audio.
- The shared shell already links here. This page links back to `/`.
- Copy is real CV content. Do not invent employers, dates, or titles.
- Read `.agents/skills/frontend-design/SKILL.md` and `.agents/skills/web-design-guidelines/SKILL.md` before changing the layout.
